## Executive Truth (Read This First)

### What Is Now Explicitly True

1️⃣ **Everything upstream of the Problem Statement is complete and correct**
The Decipher architecture has already solved the hardest part of CX:

```
Raw Signal
→ Unpacking
→ Experience Driver Identity
→ SEU (Structured Experience Unit – state primitive)
→ OU (Orchestration Unit – execution primitive)
→ Problem Statement (CX-pure entry gate)
