## The Final Architectural Claim

This system rests on **three rigorously separated truths**:
1. **CX Truth** — what customers experienced
2. **System Evidence** — what systems did (optional support)
3. **Organisational Reality** — what the organisation can change

PDCA exists **only** to arbitrate between them.

